{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07454","headline":"北归入至德州界偶逢洛阳邻家李光宰 · 刘长卿","name":"北归入至德州界偶逢洛阳邻家李光宰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生涯心事已蹉跎，旧路依然此重过。\n近北始知黄叶落，向南空见白云多。\n炎州日日人将老，寒渚年年水自波。\n华发相逢俱若是，故园秋草复如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07454.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07454","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}